<title>POLAND: DOMPLAST APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</title>
<headline>DOMPLAST APRIL NET FALLS TO PLN 0.4 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.40 vs   0.74</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.75 vs   1.19</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.86 vs   1.17</p>
<p> Sales		    6.95 vs   5.46</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     2.11 vs   3.87</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 3.60 vs   6.54</p>
<p> Operating profit     3.99 vs   6.37</p>
<p> Sales		   27.21 vs  23.92</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish plastic houseware goods maker is</p>
<p>Domplast SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
